0.19.1
- Returned to plain release.major.minor versioning.
- Ground resource boxes are selectable and show material, amount and condition in an adjacent status frame.
- Added buildable Storage Dome with 100,000 kg material capacity.
- In debug mode, DEL transfers a selected ground resource box into an available completed Storage Dome.

0.19.0-dev.1
- Switched development builds to SemVer prerelease numbering: MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH-dev.N.
- Demolishing habitat/resource structures drops the materials actually consumed by completed construction stages onto the ground.
- Dropped material piles occupy ground and invalidate overlapping structure placement.
- Normal mode now reserves the remaining staged cost of active construction when validating new builds, preventing material overcommit; debug mode still permits negative stock.

